From: Mathias <77238760+MathiasMortus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 10:06:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 62/63] =?UTF-8?q?Glint:=20native=20self-updater=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20download,=20stage,=20swap,=20relaunch?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

glint://update-start/<url> downloads a release zip (github.com/
Glint-browser/* only) via the browser network stack with progress
streamed into the Glint UI extension's storage, stages and validates the
bundle under the user data dir, and strips quarantine. glint://
update-restart atomically swaps the staged bundle over the running app
(previous kept for rollback) and relaunches through a detached shell —
the stock relauncher's helper lives inside the bundle that was just
moved. Profile-affecting switches are forwarded so the relaunched
instance lands in the same profile.
